tica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">支付宝正式上线AI开放平台，支持智能体一次接入多端分发</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">国家发改委预测：今年我国AI手机与AI电脑销量将首次超越传统产品</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">TeraWulf与Anthropic签署20年租赁协议，共建401兆瓦AI数据中心</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌更新隐私政策，默认将用户媒体数据纳入AI模型训练范畴</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/95c14a8dbbf156eb82cc91b368fda7c7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌近期低调调整隐私政策，将用户上传的图片、文件、音频及视频等媒体数据，默认纳入其AI模型训练范畴，旨在提升模型准确性、安全性及产品体验。此次变动覆盖搜索、翻译、地图、购物、航班及酒店预订等核心服务，且谷歌已将“搜索服务历史”与“网页与应用活动记录”拆分为独立选项，意味着旧有的保留期限设置不再自动覆盖新逻辑。谷歌表示，数据处理有时会配合人工审核。若用户希望规避此类数据采集，需手动前往隐私设置页面，在“搜索服务历史记录”与“个性化推荐”配置区取消勾选“保存媒体”选项。此外，用户仍可自定义数据自动删除周期，包括3个月、18个月或36个月。此举反映了科技巨头在AI大模型竞争中，正通过用户产生的数据构建竞争壁垒，建议用户定期检查账户隐私设置，以确保个人数字资产处于可控范围。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯云开发升级微信AI小程序计划，免费发放10亿Token额度及10万张生图额度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/79d3cc7b12e157a4f48f7bb507f1b506.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯云开发今日宣布微信AI小程序成长计划大幅加码，向全行业开发者免费提供10亿Token大模型额度，并将AI生图免费额度从1万张提升至10万张。此次升级核心在于模型底层的迭代，小程序内嵌AI模型已全线升级至腾讯最新一代混元Hy3模型及Hy Image 3.0生图模型，旨在提升文本理解力与画面生成效果。所有申请成功的资源包有效期长达6个月，全行业、全类目开发者均可无门槛参与。针对新人开发者，腾讯提供6个月免费个人版云开发环境；老用户则可获得系统配置升级或120元代金券。该计划旨在通过降低算力成本，支持文娱、工具、社交等行业的开发者利用旗舰级AI能力进行研发与运营，助力开发者在深度合成领域实现技术落地与业务增长。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">支付宝正式上线AI开放平台，支持智能体一次接入多端分发</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/415af6cd6bb68ffd151242be8f0df641.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月7日，支付宝正式上线AI开放平台，面向商家、服务商及智能终端等生态伙伴开启邀测。该平台旨在构建智能体（Agent）从生成到分发、交互和支付的跨端互联中枢。商家通过该平台将服务封装为MCP插件、Skill或Agent后，可实现“一次接入，多端分发”，服务不仅能接入支付宝“阿宝”，还可跨端触达手机、车机、AI眼镜及IoT等智能终端。支付宝事业群总裁李俊表示，此举旨在推动“人找服务”向“服务找人”转变。在技术基建方面，平台联合Agentar提供全栈开发支持，并集成ACT 2.0协议保障支付信任，同时推出AHA（Agent Hub Access）接口协议，解决跨应用、跨设备的智能体互联协同问题。目前，肯德基、瑞幸、滴滴等品牌已首批接入，覆盖餐饮、出行及文旅等高频场景。该平台通过统一接口降低了商家的重复开发成本，并支</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">国家发改委预测：今年我国AI手机与AI电脑销量将首次超越传统产品</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c2a0233fc9a39368844df701d8402cf0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">国家发改委在上海新闻发布会上披露，我国人工智能产业渗透率已突破80%，预计今年AI手机与AI电脑的销量将历史性地首次超越传统非AI产品。为加速技术落地，官方已在全国布局30多个国家人工智能应用中试基地，推动央企与国企开放超1000个应用场景。在应用端，我国人工智能原生办公智能体月访问量已突破2000万次，日均词元调用量达数百万亿次。政策层面，工信部正通过加强具身智能与信息通信的融合创新，加速培育智能化终端体系。第三方机构预测，今年全球生成式AI手机出货量占比将达45%。随着政策与市场需求共振，智能终端正迎来“换脑”式爆发增长，行业已进入技术迭代与规模化应用的关键阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">TeraWulf与Anthropic签署20年租赁协议，共建401兆瓦AI数据中心</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ec7a4a5bdde6522dde5ebc0e9eb5277.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">能源基础设施公司TeraWulf与AI巨头Anthropic达成深度战略合作，双方签署为期20年的数据中心租赁协议。TeraWulf位于肯塔基州Hawesville的“Justified Data”站点将成为Anthropic的核心算力基地，该项目设施容量上限达401兆瓦。项目预计于2027年下半年投入运营，并于2028年初实现全面产能释放，预计为TeraWulf带来约190亿美元的长期合约收入。此外，TeraWulf正加速向AI基础设施服务商转型，已将其德克萨斯州Abernathy项目50.1%的权益出售给由Fluidstack领衔的财团，旨在优化资产配置并聚焦高战略价值业务。此次合作旨在应对日益增长的AI模型训练算力需求，通过大规模基础设施建设，为全球AI产业提供长期稳定的算力支撑。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
